  "description": "Crosstour is a great option for your daily commute or neighborhood adventures. Built with a lightweight aluminum frame and an alloy crown front suspension fork, rest assured that you're getting a smooth and comfortable ride. The 21 speed drivetrain is equipped with easy to use twist shifters, allow you to effortlessly change gears and tackle a wide variety of terrains. The front and rear linear side pull brakes provide reliable stopping power in any weather conditions. Plus, with the deluxe padded saddle and quick release height adjustable seat post, you can customize your ride for maximum comfort. Designed with lightweight alloy wheels and 700c x 38c road tires, the Kent Crosstour is both efficient and nimble. With the frame mounted rear rack you can easily carry your essentials and the fenders help you stay dry on wet roads. Whether you're commuting to work, running errands, or simply enjoying a leisurely ride around the neighborhood, the 700c Kent Crosstour has you covered.",
